_rp_entered_note:"Qusay confirmed it — the next sync checks it, then the bill goes back where it was.",ab_missed_badge:"not in Al-Ameen",ab_missed_line:"Qusay confirmed this price, but Al-Ameen still has it blank",ab_missed_blank:"«{n}» is still unpriced in Al-Ameen — type {p}",ab_missed_why:"These were marked «Entered in Al-Ameen», but the sync that came after ({t}) did not find them there.",ab_left_err:"Could not check price changes on bills that are now fully priced",ab_archive_note:"📜 2025 is a closed book — goods that went out and were never charged. Price them on the ORIGINAL 2025 bill, in the 2025 book. ⚠ Never raise a new sales bill in 2026: the goods left the warehouse in 2025, and a new bill would deduct them from stock a second time. If the customer's current balance also needs correcting, that takes a journal adjustment in 2026 (an entry with no items, so no stock moves) — the opening entry was already posted.",ab_archive_hint:"From the closed 2025 book — price it on the original 2025 bill. ⚠ Do not raise a new bill in 2026; it would deduct the goods from stock twice.",ab_sql_hint:"Needs the alameen_bills table — paste sql/phase6_command_truth.sql in Supabase.",ab_ready:"priced — ready for Al-Ameen",ab_entered:"entered in Al-Ameen",ab_save:"Save prices",ab_write:"Type these prices on bill #{n} in Al-Ameen",ab_price_in:"Price in",ab_cur_note:"The Al-Ameen bill is in {c} — we convert it for Qusay at the bill-date rate ({r})",ab_on_bill:"on the bill",ab_write_cur:"The prices above are in {p}, the bill is in {c} — type the figure marked «≈» (bill-date rate {d}: {r})",cur_usd:"USD",cur_syp:"SYP",ab_entered_btn:"Entered in Al-Ameen",ab_entered_note:"Entered in Al-Ameen — leaves the list on the next sync.",ab8_sql_hint:"Needs the abill_prices table — paste sql/phase8_bill_pricing.sql in Supabase.",ob_edit_needs_net:"Editing needs a connection — the old slip must be voided on the server in the same step. Your lines are saved; retry when back online.",ob_done_tit